    <!-- Welcome -->
    <string name="w1_title">Your mind is a kite</string>
    <string name="w1_text">All day it drifts off: into the past, into the future, into cares. That’s what minds do. The trick is to notice, and bring it back.</string>
    <string name="w2_title">A tug on the string</string>
    <string name="w2_text">A few times a day, a soft buzz and one question: where are you? One tap. If you’d drifted, fifteen seconds to reel in: one thing you see, one sound, one feeling.</string>
    <string name="w3_title">When to tug</string>
    <string name="w3_text">Pick the hours. Tugs come at moments you can’t guess.</string>

